    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc34d1ffe92eacb60d1fecac",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3120ebb99ff900ddebab83d13f60eeab57019d410d35f7042f59d954126cbae6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "23015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/23015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24c378e5c99bde85de169897",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还差一步，这前方就是…目标的光辉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e29ae7d69984cf05820064a3a7c46af0ba13d93400a052d265689f0d3fd978",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/30000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2266daf3ab78f4453e773ebb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下次一定会有更好的结果…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "471db7f731913f1b4979fe817e520775a71dc0c3077610aee16a665eb182cfe9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/30001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3dd86d3bee9c7d4dbb7e87d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拼搏过后的结果，请满足地等待吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4438df794fea060ad415ea528a90da61f7def1ad794248746b93c7f56cb1f48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/30002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3f994a9899f21bacd24acbc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…还要从1开始重新锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1962b5b4b6397b762d1c9d6bf485fb31245b28c5e0c017c26cd1087d43e9579b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/30003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041953219d92fad1457cc570",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我活着的证明，将在这里刻下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd27de4c2aad85afb9fed43224a4a555cd95598dd5e2b19781ab100649db0d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/30004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c72be5a081500581a49c3a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "玻璃的光辉，照亮了我的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47e0ce76627e38872fb853052f05ddb8a912cddca0c03ed3eeecea8c54a7fed0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/30005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e6600e9261109037a05d84",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来，把手给我，\r\n我的舞伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf136d880ffdcfd727c4c66bd337ea5d851f7e7669a638bc78cb365f567c4a9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/30006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43b10ea847a0be2f0e95e4b4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "玻璃的光辉照亮了我的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a835a6ed1e6a7dbbc368550427d8f64f37f0195b5dc37ffe0b4cb381df5021dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "30007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/30007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1657f25865e76ddc8ac0e75",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "31000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/31000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:639b71c6d51d6bbcbbcce94c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "玻璃之翼，闪耀吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad7304f3b58779e3d0999c630268b80c7f9dd1878067e7e1691a08055436d8ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/40000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b3fe7c6c1ad5404d3677ff",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若没有事先预习舞蹈，\r\n可能会敌不过千代王的热情，\r\n让我甚至无法顺利担任领舞者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "382ee2262c70969571204f34542cf39e2e46f6f33a83b2a598e07aa5d976b4cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a44459d6c7f8927f2b22981e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "平常很少有机会像这样和大家\r\n一起挑战某个目标……\r\n虽然辛苦，但很开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea6005b99f8cebff4b2f13acbe5719e1244024a4cef1f67e4f313f3ecce7c0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1b16f980f1468c7b8673db",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好久没有与姐姐一起\r\n做点什么了。\r\n……有种奇妙的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a99d5cb63ace0f87e3425ef039af8f22249225f5d249951a8dee3c91eaf196d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1b5642c5541151d1ed4729",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着樱花决心绽放而努力的身影，\r\n雪是否都忍不住为它着急了呢？\r\n……好了，花开的时刻到来啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f895f0988dfd01d9c9af62ce793df7db84eab8d87f25d03999de131e332da9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a43f74ee8e0329d5c42cfdb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虚无缥缈的玻璃之身啊，高悬苍穹。\n因为那个身体，比谁都要闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a89d559924531fcb5be02d0dfdeeebdedf828b0f0b062f49888ef5e4ce907b0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/40001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f0d616208bc1115fe612ab",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论季节流逝得多快……我想在\r\n分道扬镳前，好好珍惜我们一起\r\n度过的时光──珍惜「现在」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ed59c0d8cc2acf43fc4979d95106ef85295d36ad4647915c32808f2fa67b2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f444067877686d8d4a1624",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千代王把我参加仪式时的\r\n照片传给我了……\r\n呵呵，感觉有点难为情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70d030acbfeec93f614f13de1f08963eeb31cec58971ab7f9a5eef849d7a5c45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e062b4935669f8b1ed021e4c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这些是活动任务。\r\n珍惜每一天，\r\n好好努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "819e903ddc3c69d9125cd41ab2724de52dcfbc430073557ccfe6d57807c1cd41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6138b00940d448f720a62e84",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有忘记领取奖励吧？\r\n小心不要遗漏任何东西，\r\n活用于未来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d9d81a55a0add816c60a21706ce739260f28f2403f0cc0a798bcaa43eff37fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ddacfb9beead4f1d0afa16",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当新芽探头，很快就会迎来\r\n围绕着崭新冠冕的季节了。\r\n来，让我们开始着手准备吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7e0401125bb56bacc3456fae5bfbac46bdaa78a3ef9b84121a0d882502c109",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dd7c3be1304b9ea2c565405",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "瞬间的花舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56f1a909c75633b332b5a7aab4d0567d1ec1cb453f920974bdfaa3744a18246b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/40003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d5be571a82ae33f463927e7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵然是……终将凋零的花朵，\r\n也要把握有限的当下──！\r\n让我们一起盛开吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66bd14c8f99af407a6312699dfd663696e9105ba4035f7f8b25c75878a3580f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "40004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/40004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78611a0e826e952414c46c70",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以前也有帮姐姐代理过事情……\n记得上一次是，演讲。姐姐她，\n一向不愿意谈赛跑相关的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "102a940aba6a3808e0d8fd9076c6a46557b23f9b139ca71844234e33864ea305",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400093"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400093"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9626c5d7b69d3e012c0ae5d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "姐姐什么也没说。\n只是看着我的脸，微微眯起了眼睛。\n……呵呵，然后就这么结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78a3c577c9d69df4c09e9846c8accabb35f83233b6c2e18232ec1e38239550d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "400095"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1071/400095"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74a6f787f53baff2e1fe8607",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
